{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../GroupCallParticipant/", "title": "GroupCallParticipant"}, "next": {"link": "../Restriction/", "title": "Restriction"}, "title": "InviteLinkImporter", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"invitelinkimporter\">\n<h1>InviteLinkImporter<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#invitelinkimporter\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.InviteLinkImporter\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">InviteLinkImporter</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.InviteLinkImporter\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The date and user of when someone has joined with an invite link.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>date</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/datetime.html#datetime.datetime\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">datetime</span></code></a>) \u2013 The time of when this user used the given link</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>user</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../User/#pyrogram.types.User\" title=\"pyrogram.types.User\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">User</span></code></a>) \u2013 The user that has used the given invite link</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "",